.Dd October 5, 2026
.Dt COXSWAIN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm coxswain ,
.Nm cox
.Nd two-pane file manager for the terminal
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar left
.Op Ar right
.Nm
.Fl -setup-search
.Nm
.Fl -index-service Cm on | off
.Nm
.Fl -meaning Ar setting
.Nm
.Fl -dump-config | -config-path | -paths | -languages | -version | -help
.Nm
.Fl -whats-new
.Op Cm all
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a file manager in the Norton Commander tradition: two panels side by side, the function
keys along the bottom, and git status in every panel.
It finds files by name across the whole machine as you type, searches inside documents,
and can search by meaning with a model that runs on the machine itself.
.Nm cox
is the same program under a shorter name.
.Pp
The panels open at
.Ar left
and
.Ar right
when they are given.
A file opens its folder with the cursor on it.
.Pp
Press
.Ic F1
in the program for the keys, and
.Ic F9
for the menus.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -dump-config
Print the full default configuration.
Redirect it to the configuration file to customise it.
.It Fl -config-path
Print where the configuration file is read from.
.It Fl -paths
Print where everything is kept: configuration, state, file index, search store and model.
.It Fl -setup-search
Set up search inside files, search by meaning and Ask, step by step.
It finds the model servers on this machine and says what suits it.
.It Fl -index-service Cm on | off
Start the search helper with the desktop session, or stop doing so.
On
.Fx
this writes an XDG autostart entry,
.Pa ~/.config/autostart/coxswain-index.desktop .
.It Fl -meaning Cm on | off | delete
Search by meaning: download the built-in model and turn it on, turn it off,
or turn it off and delete the model.
.It Fl -meaning Cm ollama Op Ar model
Take the vectors from Ollama on this machine
.Pq bge-m3 unless a model is named; it is pulled if missing .
.It Fl -meaning Cm server Ar url model
Take the vectors from a server with the OpenAI API.
.It Fl -meaning Cm builtin | cpu | auto
Back to the built-in model; on the processor only; or on a GPU where one can be used.
.It Fl -meaning Cm ask Ar model | Cm off
The chat model that answers questions from your files in Find file.
.It Fl -languages
List the languages and how to help improve a new translation.
.It Fl -whats-new Op Cm all
Show what the versions since you last looked brought.
.It Fl -version
Print the version.
.It Fl -help
Print a summary of the options.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width XDG_CONFIG_HOME
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Where the configuration is kept, if set.
.It Ev XDG_CACHE_HOME
Where the file index and the search store are kept, if set.
.It Ev VISUAL , Ev EDITOR
The editor
.Ic F4
opens, unless the configuration names one.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It Pa ~/.config/coxswain/config.toml
The configuration.
.It Pa ~/.cache/coxswain/
The file index, the search store and the search helper's address.
.It Pa ~/.local/share/Trash/
Where deleted files go, as other desktop programs expect.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
Open the current folder on the left and the home folder on the right:
.Pp
.Dl $ coxswain . ~
.Pp
Start the search helper at login from now on:
.Pp
.Dl $ coxswain --index-service on
